---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="页面不存在｜灵动云官网" description="你访问的页面不存在或已移动。可以返回灵动云官网首页查看 9 档套餐，或通过官网资料与网站地图找到需要的页面。" path="/404/" noindex>
  <section class="nf container">
    <div class="nf-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 520 200" focusable="false">
        <ellipse cx="260" cy="100" rx="240" ry="56" transform="rotate(-10 260 100)" />
        <ellipse cx="260" cy="100" rx="170" ry="36" transform="rotate(-10 260 100)" />
        <circle cx="478" cy="58" r="3" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <p class="code">404</p>
    <h1>页面不存在</h1>
    <p class="msg">你访问的地址可能输入有误，或页面已被移动。客户端教程、套餐选择、问题排查与新手入门分别在灵动云的其他官方站点，入口见官方站点说明。</p>
    <div class="acts">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/#pricing">查看套餐</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/guides/lingdongyun-official/">官方站点说明</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/sitemap/">网站地图</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .nf { position: relative; text-align: center; padding: 112px var(--gutter) 136px; }
  .nf-mark { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 72px; width: min(520px, 92vw); transform: translateX(-50%); pointer-events: none; }
  .nf-mark ellipse { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent-hi); stroke-width: 1; stroke-opacity: 0.18; }
  .nf-mark ellipse:first-child { stroke-dasharray: 2 8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-opacity: 0.3; }
  .nf-mark circle { fill: #f1ebff; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.9)); }
  .code {
    position: relative; font-size: clamp(88px, 16vw, 160px); font-weight: 200; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: #f6f2fd; text-shadow: 0 0 48px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45);
  }
  h1 { position: relative; margin-top: 24px; font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 34px); }
  .msg { max-width: 36em; margin: 14px auto 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .acts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 40px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .nf { padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
    .nf-mark { top: 48px; }
    .acts .btn { flex: 1 1 140px; }
  }
</style>
